msgid "3D MHD Test: Magnetosphere"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "地球磁気圏に太陽風が吹き付け、地球磁気圏が変形する様子をシミュレーションします。{cite}`ogino_1986JGR....91.6791O`を参考にして、地球の中心から地球半径の3.5倍の位置にも境界を設置し、地球の双極子磁場とスムーズに接続するようにしています。"
msgstr "This simulates how the solar wind blows against Earth's magnetosphere and deforms it. Following {cite}`ogino_1986JGR....91.6791O`, we also place a boundary at 3.5 Earth radii from the center of the Earth and connect it smoothly to the Earth's dipole magnetic field."

msgid "Location"
msgstr ""

msgid "`demo/mhd3d_magnetosphere/`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Normalization"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "物理量は以下の代表値で規格化しています。{cite}`ogino_1986JGR....91.6791O`ではMKS単位系が使われていますが、本シミュレーションではcgs単位系を使用していることに注意してください。"
msgstr "The variables are normalized by the following typical values. Note that {cite}`ogino_1986JGR....91.6791O` uses MKS units, whereas this simulation uses cgs units."

msgid "Quantity"
msgstr ""

msgid "Symbol"
msgstr ""

msgid "Value"
msgstr ""

msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

msgid "Length"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$R_\\mathrm{e}$"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$6.371 \\times 10^8~\\rm{cm}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Earth radius"
msgstr ""

msgid "Magnetic Field"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$B_\\mathrm{s}$"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$3.12 \\times 10^{-1}~\\rm{G}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Strength at earth equator surface"
msgstr ""

msgid "Density"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\rho_\\mathrm{s}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$1.67 \\times 10^{-20}~\\mathrm{g~cm^{-3}}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Typical density of ionosphere"
msgstr ""

msgid "Then the other quantities are normalized as follows."
msgstr ""

msgid "Velocity"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$V_\\mathrm{s}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$B_{\\rm{s}}/\\sqrt{4\\pi \\rho_{\\rm{s}}}=6.81\\times 10^8~\\rm{cm~s^{-1}}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "time"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$t_\\mathrm{s}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$R_{\\rm{e}}/V_{\\rm{s}}=0.935~\\rm{s}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Pressure"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$p_\\mathrm{s}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$B_{\\rm{s}}^2/4\\pi=7.74\\times 10^{-3}~\\rm{dyn~cm^{-2}}$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Geometry"
msgstr ""

msgid "$-44.8 \\leq x \\leq 44.8$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$-44.8 \\leq y \\leq 44.8$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$-44.8 \\leq z \\leq 44.8$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Force"
msgstr ""

msgid "地球の中心に向かう重力を考慮します。"
msgstr "We take into account gravity directed toward the center of the Earth."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\rho \\bm{v}}{\\partial t} &= [...] + \\rho \\bm{g}, \\\\\n"
"\\bm{g} & = -\\frac{g_0}{r^3} \\left(x \\bm{e}_x + y\\bm{e}_y + z\\bm{e}_z\\right),\\\\\n"
"r^2 &= x^2 + y^2 + z^2,\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "where $g_0=1.35\\times10^{-6}$ in normalized unit."
msgstr ""

msgid "Initial Conditions"
msgstr ""

msgid "初期条件は、磁気圏と太陽風の組み合わせで記述されます。比熱比は$\\gamma = 5/3$とします。"
msgstr "The initial condition is described by a combination of the magnetosphere and the solar wind. The ratio of specific heats is $\\gamma = 5/3$."

msgid "密度"
msgstr "Density"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\rho &=\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1/r^3 & 1/r^3 \\geq 0.2\\rho_\\mathrm{sw} \\\\\n"
"0.2\\rho_\\mathrm{sw} & 1/r^2 < 0.2\\rho_\\mathrm{sw}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "圧力"
msgstr "Pressure"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"p =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"p_0/r^2 & p_0/r^2 \\geq p_\\mathrm{sw} \\\\\n"
"p_\\mathrm{sw} & p_0/r^2 < p_\\mathrm{sw}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "双極子磁場"
msgstr "Dipole magnetic field"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\bm{B} &= \\frac{1}{r^5}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"-3xz \\\\\n"
"-3yz \\\\\n"
"x^2 + y^2 - 2z^2\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "ここで$p_0 = 5.4\\times10^{-7}$。 太陽風のパラメータは、$\\rho_\\mathrm{sw}=5\\times10^{-4}$、$p_\\mathrm{sw}=3.56\\times10^{-8}$、$v_\\mathrm{sw}=0.05$、$B_\\mathrm{sw}=-1.5\\times10^{-4}$です。"
msgstr "Here $p_0 = 5.4\\times10^{-7}$. The solar wind parameters are $\\rho_\\mathrm{sw}=5\\times10^{-4}$, $p_\\mathrm{sw}=3.56\\times10^{-8}$, $v_\\mathrm{sw}=0.05$, and $B_\\mathrm{sw}=-1.5\\times10^{-4}$."

msgid "Boundary Conditions"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "すべての境界に対して、$x = -44.8$境界を除き、全ての物理量に対して対称境界条件を設定します。$x = -44.8$境界では、上記の太陽風のパラメータを固定境界条件として設定します。`config.yaml`では以下のように設定します。加えて、地球周辺($r = 3.5R_\\mathrm{E}$)に境界のような条件を設定し、双極子磁場とスムーズに接続するようにしています。"
msgstr "A symmetric boundary condition is imposed on all variables at all boundaries except the $x = -44.8$ boundary. At the $x = -44.8$ boundary, the solar wind parameters above are imposed as a fixed boundary condition. This is set in `config.yaml` as follows. In addition, a boundary-like condition is imposed around the Earth ($r = 3.5R_\\mathrm{E}$) so that it connects smoothly to the dipole magnetic field."

msgid "Results"
msgstr ""

msgid "可視化用のPythonスクリプトが用意されています。 結果のプロットは `demo/mhd3d_magnetosphere/figs` に保存されます。"
msgstr "A Python script for visualization is provided. The plots of the results are saved in `demo/mhd3d_magnetosphere/figs`."

